[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13501.469, "timestamp": "03:45:01", "text": "工艺"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13503.67, "timestamp": "03:45:03", "text": "多人游戏。必须非常非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13506.59, "timestamp": "03:45:06", "text": "非常擅长"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13510.03, "timestamp": "03:45:10", "text": "他们。歌词正在播放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13523.95, "timestamp": "03:45:23", "text": "大家都在玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13527.67, "timestamp": "03:45:27", "text": "这。只有在金钱不是问题的情况下，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13530.229, "timestamp": "03:45:30", "text": "我本来会把这些东西全买下来。不，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13531.99, "timestamp": "03:45:31", "text": "我认为他们是免费得到的，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13535.55, "timestamp": "03:45:35", "text": "算是吧？因为来自"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13539.51, "timestamp": "03:45:39", "text": "就像对的。因为如果你像这样得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13541.91, "timestamp": "03:45:41", "text": "如果你有赞助商之类的，那就很好了。你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13544.389, "timestamp": "03:45:44", "text": "这笔钱是从赞助商那里来的，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13554.83, "timestamp": "03:45:54", "text": "某物。它其实是一款制作模拟游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13558.07, "timestamp": "03:45:58", "text": "尽管。这让我不禁想起了日程安排。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13559.469, "timestamp": "03:45:59", "text": "一个"}]